  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership Activity 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall purpose of this Partnership Activity is to develop a comprehensive three-year strategic plan that will guide MeCAHT&#x2019;s and EXIST institutional partnership growth, sustainability, and program effectiveness 2026-2028. 
By the end of the activity, MeCAHT and EXIST will have a renewed, inclusive, and actionable Strategic Plan (2026&#x2013;2028) that strengthens its institutional sustainability, enhances program alignment, and positions the organization as a more accountable and resilient actor in the fight against human trafficking.
Representatives from MeCAHT and EXIST boards and staffs will be present in the Partnership Activity retreat.</narrative>
  </description>
